      'Ask your travel insurer: "Does this policy exclude planned medical treatment and its complications?" Ask the clinic: "If I need revision work, who pays for the procedure, the flights and the hotel?" Ask both: "What happens in the first 72 hours after I land home?" The pattern of answers maps your real coverage.',
      '## How Itinerary of Türkiye Helps',
