      '## Does it Hurt?',
      'This is one of the most common questions — and the honest answer is very little. The preparation process involves minimal shaving of the tooth surface, carried out under local anaesthesia. Most patients report mild sensitivity in the days following treatment, which passes quickly. The overall experience is far more comfortable than most people expect, and the results make every moment of it entirely worthwhile.',
