    title: 'Rhinoplasty in Türkiye — How to Choose the Right Surgeon and Clinic',
    category: 'Medical Tourism',
    excerpt: 'Rhinoplasty is among the most transformative procedures in cosmetic surgery — and the one where the surgeon matters most. How to choose well in Türkiye.',
    coverImage: '/images/pexels-3764013-700x900.jpg',
    date: 'August 2026',
